  "solenoids": {
    "notes": [
      "System 11A D-11392 solenoid architecture identical to Space Station. SOL1-8 via U28 latch, SOL9-16 via U10 PB ($2100), specials SS1-SS6 via dedicated drivers.",
      "A/C RELAY (Sol12): A-coils active when Sol12 de-energized, C-coils (flashers) active when Sol12 energized.",
      "Sol13 and Sol14 are Mystery Wheel stepper coils (coil B and coil A respectively). Two-coil stepper -- both must be sequenced correctly. DIAGNOSTIC: sustained or rapid firing of Sol13/14 may cause voltage sag and resets.",
      "Sol16 (Ferris Wheel motor relay) is a continuous-run device during Ferris Wheel sequences. DIAGNOSTIC: monitor sustained Sol16 activity.",
      "Sol22 Special #6 is Not Used on Cyclone.",
      "bcd_code: null throughout -- PIA write values to be determined via scan_trace on live board.",
      "Coil part numbers: AE-23-800, AE-24-900, AE-26-1200, AE-26-1500 (note 1500-ohm variant used on Boomerang and slingshots)."
    ],
